T:No, Not One!
T:NO NOT ONE
C:Music: George Crawford Hugg, 1894 · Words: Johnson Oatman, Jr, 1894
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Pentecostal Hymns, No. 2" 1898 page 1. Setting and hymn identical to that found in "Pentecostal Hymns, Nos. 1 and 2 combined", 1894 Hymn 305. ABC file contribu. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/harper_memorial_hugg): 100% of pitches and 99% of note lengths agree.
